          "filename": "Kilauea Lighthouse 04.jpg",
          "caption": "This is an image of Kilauea Point Lighthouse and wildlife refuge on the island of Kauai in Hawaii. It was taken in March of 2015 during the Laysan albatross and red-footed booby bird nesting season. The birds on the lawn in front of the lighthouse are Nene, or Hawaiian geese, the endangered state bird of Hawaii. Before the trip, I was told I wouldn't see these birds on the island of Kauai, but there were many of them.",
          "alt": "This is an image of Kilauea Point Lighthouse and wildlife refuge on the island of Kauai in Hawaii. It was taken in March of 2015 during the Laysan albatross and red-footed booby bird nesting season. The birds on the lawn in front of the lighthouse are Nene, or Hawaiian geese, the endangered state bird of Hawaii. Before the trip, I was told I wouldn't see these birds on the island of Kauai, but there were many of them.",
